  "description": "Modern Metal for Dirt. The ultimate smooth riding, clean looking but practical Ti gravel bike. The Kite comes with a completely redesigned and unique titanium fork with 3D printed crown and dropouts.\n\nThe model has evolved over the 15 years since, now crafted from Titanium, employing additive manufacturing methods to provide the ultimate smooth riding, clean looking modern gravel bike.\n\nDress it up any way you please – plush 45mm tyres and ‘guards for winter roads, 30s for some summer speed, ‘cross tyres and hit a race or two, it can even take some full 29\" or 27.5\" mtb tyres for some singletrack action.\n\nWe select each individual tube in each frame size to ensure optimal ride characteristics for that frame size - and the corresponding size and weight of rider expected to be riding it.",
